## Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Real Supabase credentials. Copy Supabase.example.plist to Supabase.plist and
# fill it in. Kept out of git so this repo can be made public at any moment
# without a key sitting in its history — and because RLS is off, which makes
# the anon key a full read/write credential rather than a public one.
CareAid/Resources/Supabase.plist

## Supabase CLI local state
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
